<title>SRI LANKA: CRICKET-SRI LANKA BEAT INDIA BY 9 WICKETS IN ONE-DAY MATCH.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SRI LANKA BEAT INDIA BY 9 WICKETS IN ONE-DAY MATCH.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sri Lanka beat India by nine wickets in the second match of the Singer World Series one-day (50 overs) cricket tournament on Monday.</p>
<p>Scores: India 226-5 in 50 overs, Sri Lanka 230-1 in 44.2 overs.</p>
